  "title": "Mom's Spiced Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "Mom's spiced zucchini bread recipe is flavored with cinnamon, cloves, and nutmeg for a tasty breakfast treat or a thoughtful gift for a foodie friend.",
  "authors": [
